    "title": "Riverhead Fire Department honors Robert Szczepanik for 50 years of service - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Denise Civiletti ,\n6 hours ago Robert Szczepanik has spent much of his life serving others — in the military, as a postal worker and, for the past half-century, as a volunteer firefighter. The Riverhead Fire Department honored Szczepanik Tuesday night at fire department headquarters, celebrating his 50 years of service with Red Bird Hook and Ladder Company No. 1. Read full article",
